From: chaorenex1 <24537608z@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 11:25:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Render plugin adviser rows as cards in the TUI

The gateway emits message.adviser with plugin_message_id, and a resumed transcript carries the same row with display_kind=adviser. Draw both as an adviser block (severity tone, label, parsed body) instead of a user-turn bubble, deduping the live card by id so the hydrate cannot double it. The web chat runs the TUI over a PTY, so it inherits the same card. The gateway now announces only display_kind=adviser rows: plugin_message_callback also fires for a mid-turn steer, which is the operator's words and keeps its own surface path.
---
